  "dynamic": "Add versioned owner S/H/O or Q (QA fixture) and other scoped executable subunits plus all audit/merge dependencies before consumer acceptance; no dependency on its own requester acceptance. Validate DAG and lease wait graph on each insertion. G* virtual gates are read-only, Q.* fixture code is an audited unit. Read-only units use no-op merge with independent evidence. Trial merge uses exact candidate SHA and accepted parent in a unique worktree; only independent integrated AUD + QA and journaled CAS advance the never-checked-out accepted branch. Rejected trial never enters accepted ancestry. Release contested leases while waiting."
}
